BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:year-visit-window@stu-bot
DTSTAMP:20260826T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270501
SUMMARY:Window for Mum and your brother
DESCRIPTION:February is the driest month of the year and there is no haze. 
 It is also the first window after the hours change.\n\nPick a month and sa
 y it out loud to her. A visit without a month is a wish.\n\nTwo return far
 es run roughly GBP 1\,400-1\,900. Waive a few months of her rent and that 
 is the flight.
END:VEVENT
